Package: luci-app-upnp-client
Version: 1.3.0-1
Depends: libc, rpcd, luci-base, miniupnpc, miniupnpd-nftables, firewall4, curl, jshn
Section: luci
Category: LuCI
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Local OpenWrt package
Description: LuCI manager for upstream UPnP port mappings
 Finds the upstream NAT router, requests saved mappings, and relays
 UPnP/NAT-PMP leases from LAN devices to it. Needs firewall4.
